OL,3,GNEWSASewer will not stop town centre
OL,4,Arevamp after all
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development of a new cultural
OL,7,Fquarter to help regenerate a town
OL,8,Fcentre can restart after revised plans
OL,9,Fwere approved.
OL,11,FEast Suffolk Council's plan to
OL,12,Fredevelop land at Lowestoft's former
OL,13,FBattery Green car park and around
OL,14,FMarina Road was put on hold a year ago
OL,15,Fdue to the discovery of a sewer.
OL,17,FWork had already started, but was
OL,18,Fstalled until the plans were revised
OL,19,Fand resubmitted to the council's
OL,20,Fplanning committee.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
